{"id":"4d50daf07b07fff2","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-many-sorted-type-introduction-one-step.md","title":"A typed system with at most one step","display":"ex-many-sorted-type-introduction-one-step — A typed system with at most one step","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-many-sorted-type-introduction-one-step","aliases":["56-ex-many-sorted-type-introduction-one-step"],"display":"ex-many-sorted-type-introduction-one-step — A typed system with at most one step","depends_on":["[[56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system]]","[[56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation]]","[[56-df-terminating]]"],"source_section":"§6.5.6","source_printed_pages":"258","source_ocr_blocks":[279],"source_verification":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-many-sorted-type-introduction-one-step"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-many-sorted-type-introduction-one-step</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-many-sorted-type-introduction-one-step — A typed system with at most one step"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f47f83c51f651d3\" href=\"?note=4f47f83c51f651d3\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system\">56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"629f88abafad3e3c\" href=\"?note=629f88abafad3e3c\" title=\"56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation\">56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.5.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"258"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>279</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_1\\ne s_2\">\\(s_1\\ne s_2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\{s_1,s_2\\}\">\\(S=\\{s_1,s_2\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=\\{c_0,c_1,f\\}\">\\(\\mathcal F=\\{c_0,c_1,f\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0,c_1,f\">\\(c_0,c_1,f\\)</span> 两两不同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,\\mathcal F,a,b)\">\\(M=(S,\\mathcal F,a,b)\\)</span> 为排序签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(c_0)=a(c_1)=()\">\\(a(c_0)=a(c_1)=()\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(c_0)=b(c_1)=s_1\">\\(b(c_0)=b(c_1)=s_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(f)=(s_1,s_1,s_1)\">\\(a(f)=(s_1,s_1,s_1)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(f)=s_2\">\\(b(f)=s_2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>变量族与自由项构造满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f47f83c51f651d3\" href=\"?note=4f47f83c51f651d3\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system\">56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system</a> 的条件，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V_{s_1}\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V_{s_1}\\)</span>；排序唯一性及替换保持排序取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"629f88abafad3e3c\" href=\"?note=629f88abafad3e3c\" title=\"56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation\">56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^S\">\\(\\to_R^S\\)</span> 使用排序一步定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}\">\\(\\mathrm{Terminating}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 由下列显式规则集合确定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R\\coloneqq\\{(f(c_0,c_1,x),f(x,x,x))\\},\\qquad\nR\\in\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R\\coloneqq\\{(f(c_0,c_1,x),f(x,x,x))\\},\\qquad\nR\\in\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{s_1}=\\mathcal V_{s_1}\\cup\\{c_0,c_1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{s_1}=\\mathcal V_{s_1}\\cup\\{c_0,c_1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{s_2}=\\mathcal V_{s_2}\\cup\n\\{f(u,v,w)\\mid(u,v,w)\\in T_{s_1}^{3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{s_2}=\\mathcal V_{s_2}\\cup\n\\{f(u,v,w)\\mid(u,v,w)\\in T_{s_1}^{3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall t,u,v\\in T_S\\;\\neg(t\\to_R^S u\\land u\\to_R^S v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall t,u,v\\in T_S\\;\\neg(t\\to_R^S u\\land u\\to_R^S v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(c_0,c_1,c_0)\\to_R^S f(c_0,c_0,c_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(c_0,c_1,c_0)\\to_R^S f(c_0,c_0,c_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_S,\\to_R^S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_S,\\to_R^S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_1\">\\(s_1\\)</span> 没有输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_1\">\\(s_1\\)</span> 的正元构造器，因此其项只有变量和两个常元。唯一正元符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_2\">\\(s_2\\)</span> 而所有输入均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_1\">\\(s_1\\)</span>，故排序项不可能嵌套 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。任何可归约项都在根部形如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(c_0,c_1,w)\">\\(f(c_0,c_1,w)\\)</span>，一步后成为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(w,w,w)\">\\(f(w,w,w)\\)</span>。若此目标还能归约，则前两个参数分别要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=c_0\">\\(w=c_0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=c_1\">\\(w=c_1\\)</span>，与自由常元不同矛盾。因此任何归约链至多一步，且给出的具体一步保证该系统并非无归约关系。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，例6.5.52，印刷第258页，OCR页块279。原书用常元0、1；本文件用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0,c_1\">\\(c_0,c_1\\)</span> 避免与元数和排序索引混淆。已比对原书排序方案和“至多一步”的陈述，并完成上述本地证明。本例仅断言排序系统终止；原书进一步借定理6.5.51推出无排序系统终止，该跨定理推理未在本例中冒充已内建证明。OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"4f47f83c51f651d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"629f88abafad3e3c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"a0c9e286170288bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends